                        <li><span class="fw-bold">First Offense</span> - The Head or the Dean or OIC recommends to the Guidance Center for a suspension from classes for each offender.</li>
                        <li><span class="fw-bold">Second and Subsequent Offenses</span> - A recommendation for a heavier sanction will be endorsed to the Guidance Center.</li>
                    </ul>
